              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melissa Goff"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This rating is from my husband, I don't drink alcohol, so I made this for him, A WELCOME HOME DRINK on a night he came home from Temporary duty assignment and had been gone 3 months. He bought Spiced Rum and couldn't find Cherry vanilla cola, so he brought home just Cherry cola and I added vanilla to his drink....he really liked it. And I doubled the batch....and he polished off with a blech......so if that tells ya something--he liked it. No clue what jigger rum is, but he said it was really good. Thanks!"
          },
