            },
            "reviewBody": "To the person who didn't know what \"jigger rum\" is, it isn't rum, a jigger is a measurement. On a shaker bottle, it's the small cap that comes off the pour spout, and doubles as a measurement for about one shot. Anyway, pretty darn good",
